<graph edgedefault="directed"><node id="61c7cba3-0784-49c5-8378-e68e3de5e4f5">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Joint Survivorship Life Insurance","text":"╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║              JOINT SURVIVORSHIP LIFE INSURANCE                    ║\n║              Estate Planning Life Assurance Ltd.                  ║\n╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\nPolicy Number: EPL-JSL-2024-1156\nIssue Date: August 20, 2024\nPolicy Form: Second-to-Die Whole Life\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nJOINT INSUREDS\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nFirst Insured: William Alexander Hartford\n  DOB: December 5, 1956 | Age: 67 | Sex: Male\n  Risk Class: Standard\n\nSecond Insured: Elizabeth Anne Hartford  \n  DOB: March 18, 1958 | Age: 66 | Sex: Female\n  Risk Class: Preferred\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nPOLICY OWNER\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nThe Hartford Family Irrevocable Life Insurance Trust\nDated: August 1, 2024\nTrustee: First National Bank of Connecticut\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nCOVERAGE DETAILS\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nDeath Benefit: $2,500,000\nAnnual Premium: $32,400 (guaranteed level for 10 years)\nPremium Payor: Hartford Family Irrevocable Trust\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nBENEFICIARY\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nHartford Family Irrevocable Life Insurance Trust\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nARTICLE I - NATURE OF COVERAGE\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n1.1 This is a joint life insurance policy insuring two lives.\n\n1.2 DEATH BENEFIT TRIGGER: The death benefit is payable only upon \n    the death of the SECOND insured to die (surv","summary":"This is a second-to-die whole life insurance policy covering William A. Hartford and Elizabeth A. Hartford, with a $2.5 million death benefit paid upon the later of their deaths. The policy is owned by the Hartford Family Irrevocable Life Insurance Trust, which also serves as the beneficiary, ensuring assets pass smoothly outside of probate. Annual premiums of $32,400 are guaranteed for ten years, and the policy supports long-term estate planning objectives.","topics":["Life Insurance","Estate Planning","Joint Survivorship Policy","Irrevocable Trust"],"facts":[{"name":"Policy Identification","sentence":"The policy number is EPL-JSL-2024-1156.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Policy Number","Insurance Policy","Document Reference"],"entities":[{"name":"William Alexander Hartford","type":"PERSON","role":"first insured under policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Elizabeth Anne Hartford","type":"PERSON","role":"second insured under policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Estate Planning Life Assurance Ltd.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer of policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"First National Bank of Connecticut","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"trustee of irrevocable trust","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"The Hartford Family Irrevocable Life Insurance Trust","type":"LEGAL_ENTITY","role":"policy owner and beneficiary","relational_anchors":["Dated: August 1, 2024"]},{"name":"Joint Survivorship Life Insurance","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"contractual instrument governing coverage","relational_anchors":["Policy Number: EPL-JSL-2024-1156","Issue Date: August 20, 2024","Policy Form: Second-to-Die Whole Life"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"insurance payout trigger condition","relational_anchors":["$2,500,000","payable upon second insured's death"]},{"name":"Annual Premium","type":"FINANCIAL_TERM","role":"fixed cost of maintaining policy","relational_anchors":["$32,400","guaranteed level for 10 years"]},{"name":"August 20, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"issue date of policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"August 1, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"date trust was established","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"EPL-JSL-2024-1156","type":"IDENTIFIER","role":"unique policy number assigned by issuer","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Policy Issue Date","sentence":"The issue date of the policy is August 20, 2024.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy issue date","effective date","insurance coverage"],"entities":[{"name":"William Alexander Hartford","type":"PERSON","role":"first insured under policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Elizabeth Anne Hartford","type":"PERSON","role":"second insured under policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Estate Planning Life Assurance Ltd.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer of policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"First National Bank of Connecticut","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"trustee of irrevocable trust","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"The Hartford Family Irrevocable Life Insurance Trust","type":"LEGAL_ENTITY","role":"policy owner and beneficiary","relational_anchors":["Dated: August 1, 2024"]},{"name":"Joint Survivorship Life Insurance","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"contractual instrument governing coverage","relational_anchors":["Policy Number: EPL-JSL-2024-1156","Issue Date: August 20, 2024","Policy Form: Second-to-Die Whole Life"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"insurance payout trigger condition","relational_anchors":["$2,500,000","payable upon second insured's death"]},{"name":"Annual Premium","type":"FINANCIAL_TERM","role":"fixed cost of maintaining policy","relational_anchors":["$32,400","guaranteed level for 10 years"]},{"name":"August 20, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"issue date of policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"August 1, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"date trust was established","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"EPL-JSL-2024-1156","type":"IDENTIFIER","role":"unique policy number assigned by issuer","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"n