<node id="92205c80-33af-48b2-8ed8-450b5f0d072b">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Trust-Based Insurance Provisions","text":"2 Neither insured has ownership rights unless specified in \n     the trust document.\n\n10.3 Policy may not be assigned without trustee authorization.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nARTICLE XI - FREE LOOK PERIOD\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nThe policy owner may cancel within 30 days of policy receipt for \na full refund of premium paid.\n\n\n╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║  Estate Planning Life Assurance Ltd.                              ║\n║  Hartford, Connecticut                                            ║\n║                                                                   ║\n║  _________________________________                                ║\n║  Chairman &amp; Chief Executive Officer                               ║\n║                                                                   ║\n║  August 20, 2024                                                  ║\n╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n","summary":"Ownership of the insurance policy is contingent upon specific language in the trust document; otherwise, neither insured party holds ownership rights. The policy cannot be transferred or assigned without prior authorization from the trustee. Policyholders have a 30-day free look period after receipt during which they can cancel the policy and receive a full refund of premiums paid. This document was issued by Estate Planning Life Assurance Ltd., based in Hartford, Connecticut, on August 20, 2024.","topics":["Trust Ownership","Policy Assignment","Free Look Period","Estate Planning"],"facts":[{"name":"Ownership Rights Condition","sentence":"Neither insured has ownership rights unless specified in the trust document.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["ownership rights","trust document","insured parties","legal restrictions"],"entities":[{"name":"ownership rights","type":"CONCEPT","role":"rights granted under trust","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"the trust document","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"legal instrument specifying rights","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy","type":"POLICY","role":"insurance contract subject to rules","relational_anchors":["Article XI"]},{"name":"Policy may not be assigned without trustee authorization.","type":"RULE","role":"restriction on transferability","relational_anchors":["Section 10.3"]},{"name":"30 days","type":"PERIOD","role":"duration of free look window","relational_anchors":["within 30 days of policy receipt"]},{"name":"free look period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"cancellation window for refunds","relational_anchors":["Article XI"]},{"name":"Estate Planning Life Assurance Ltd.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer organization","relational_anchors":["Hartford, Connecticut"]},{"name":"Hartford, Connecticut","type":"LOCATION","role":"headquarters location","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Chairman &amp; Chief Executive Officer","type":"ROLE","role":"executive leadership position","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"August 20, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"date of document issuance","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Policy Assignment Restriction","sentence":"A policy may not be assigned without trustee authorization.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["trustee authorization","policy assignment","ownership transfer"],"entities":[{"name":"ownership rights","type":"CONCEPT","role":"rights granted under trust","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"the trust document","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"legal instrument specifying rights","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy","type":"POLICY","role":"insurance contract subject to rules","relational_anchors":["Article XI"]},{"name":"Policy may not be assigned without trustee authorization.","type":"RULE","role":"restriction on transferability","relational_anchors":["Section 10.3"]},{"name":"30 days","type":"PERIOD","role":