<edge source="f3706d0c-70ab-449a-acaf-73df08a50ee7" target="70b3ef60-9864-48d8-850f-5f71428d1690">
  <data key="d3">The policy number identifies the specific insurance contract, while Elizabeth’s date of birth provides personal detail relevant to underwriting and eligibility but does not affect the policy number itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNRELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f3706d0c-70ab-449a-acaf-73df08a50ee7" target="5c3f4413-4b34-4cda-af56-ca0ece4739ca">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 identifies the policy using its unique number, while fact sentence 2 specifies when the policy was formally established. Together, they help uniquely identify and timestamp the document.</data>
  <data key="d4">IDENTIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f3706d0c-70ab-449a-acaf-73df08a50ee7" target="b88d0ce3-428e-4cb8-adc0-8526b7d088da">
  <data key="d3">The policy number identifies the specific insurance contract, while William Alexander Hartford’s date of birth provides identifying personal data relevant to his eligibility under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">IDENTIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f3706d0c-70ab-449a-acaf-73df08a50ee7" target="20219f87-fba0-47ad-bf47-730051ea2a89">
  <data key="d3">Knowing the policy number does not provide any insight into William Alexander Hartford’s gender. This factual statement stands independently without reliance on administrative identifiers.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f3706d0c-70ab-449a-acaf-73df08a50ee7" target="e514cae1-517d-4147-b68b-73630549696a">
  <data key="d3">The policy number EPL-JSL-2024-1156 uniquely identifies the insurance contract that covers William Alexander Hartford as the first insured individual.</data>
  <data key="d4">REFERENCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
