<edge source="0e404f06-62de-4907-9ecb-1ee9ca03ea3f" target="f3706d0c-70ab-449a-acaf-73df08a50ee7">
  <data key="d3">The designation "Second-to-Die Whole Life" describes the nature of the policy whose unique identifier is EPL-JSL-2024-1156, defining how benefits are triggered and managed under the trust arrangement.</data>
  <data key="d4">DESCRIBES</data>
