  <data key="d3">Knowing the trustee enables verification of whether the institution can properly administer Crummey powers, making it relevant to ensure compliant transfer procedures are followed under estate planning law.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
