  <data key="d3">The designation of First National Bank of Connecticut as trustee ensures administrative control over the irrevocable trust, enabling it to manage the policy in accordance with IRS requirements necessary to exclude death benefits from the insureds' estates.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="eb6fcda1-6a00-45e2-a278-6ecbfce50c86" target="6855c874-b03e-4cfa-b68c-37e56182aa7f">
  <data key="d3">The identification of First National Bank of Connecticut as trustee provides institutional oversight relevant to complying with the three-year lookback rule during policy transfer, supporting sound trust administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
