<edge source="2d52cf57-58c0-4a1e-a4dd-d5e01496d174" target="f0afe120-e789-4e90-bc04-4eea01f53901">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit of $2.5 million represents the payout upon the insureds' passing, while the $32,400 annual premium reflects the cost to maintain coverage. These figures describe separate financial aspects of the policy.</data>
