  <data key="d3">The $2.5 million death benefit defines the payout size, while the guaranteed level premium ensures predictable cost over ten years. Together they support financial predictability in estate planning.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2d52cf57-58c0-4a1e-a4dd-d5e01496d174" target="288469c9-a76a-4bf8-b17b-752662f3a1f6">
  <data key="d3">The $2.5 million death benefit will be paid to the Hartford Family Irrevocable Life Insurance Trust, making it the recipient of the full payout upon the later of the two insureds' deaths.</data>
