  <data key="d3">The statement identifies the policy as a joint life insurance contract, which sets the foundation for understanding its use case. This structural characteristic makes it particularly suitable for long-term estate planning objectives involving dual-insured parties.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
