  <data key="d3">The statement that it is a joint life insurance policy sets the foundational nature of the contract. This context enables understanding that any existing loans would affect the final death benefit, though the existence of such loans is not implied by the policy's structure alone.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
