<edge source="f7b2d174-40c9-40e2-a0f1-fafef35a9501" target="45022529-c9d1-42d4-978a-0e7ff593425f">
  <data key="d3">Since the policy insures two lives, it operates under a survivorship model where benefits are contingent on both individuals passing away. This structural feature ensures that no death benefit is triggered by the first death alone.</data>
