  <data key="d3">Since the policy insures two lives, it logically follows that after the first death, the policy continues to provide protection for the surviving insured, ensuring ongoing benefits under the same terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
