  <data key="d3">The policy's requirement for both insureds to pass before payment hinges on its design covering two lives. Without two insured individuals, the survival-based payout mechanism would not apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f7b2d174-40c9-40e2-a0f1-fafef35a9501" target="70d6f164-2c6e-4960-9154-c1e13245d12c">
  <data key="d3">The policy insures two lives, making it suitable for estate planning where funding is required posthumously for tax obligations.</data>
