<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="ac80f582-a994-43e3-a0c9-7da66f0fc96b">
  <data key="d3">The continuation of coverage after the first death defines a key characteristic of a joint life insurance policy designed for dual-insured individuals.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="f7b2d174-40c9-40e2-a0f1-fafef35a9501">
  <data key="d3">The continuation of coverage after the first death implies that the original design included multiple insureds, confirming that the policy was intended from the start to cover two lives.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="c77b94e8-ba17-40c7-a87e-8036edb72fd7">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy stays in effect so that the second death can trigger the final payout, making continued coverage essential for fulfilling the terms outlined in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="43d8caa1-4fa2-4bcc-9598-cb51dcf031e8">
  <data key="d3">Because the policy stays in effect after the first death, its survival-based structure enables ongoing protection for the remaining individual until both have passed.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="45022529-c9d1-42d4-978a-0e7ff593425f">
  <data key="d3">Because the policy continues after the first death, it ensures that no immediate payout occurs, consistent with its survivorship structure.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONSEQUENCE_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="bfe9a0f3-fce1-4c16-a4f6-2a78f6d39acf">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy stays active for the surviving individual, ensuring continued eligibility for the final death benefit once both have passed.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70">
  <data key="d3">After the first death, the policy continues to cover the remaining individual, ensuring that the eventual death benefit aligns with estate planning objectives by providing liquidity when both parties pass.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="70d6f164-2c6e-4960-9154-c1e13245d12c">
  <data key="d3">After the first death, the policy continues to cover the remaining individual, ensuring ongoing financial protection. This sustained coverage supports the policy’s broader use case: providing funds for estate taxes when both insureds pass.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS PURPOSE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="30aa32c7-4f8f-42cf-99bf-592ed9d2eaab">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy continues to cover the remaining individual, preserving eligibility for the final death benefit when the second insured passes.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="69f86d86-8dc3-4e5c-963e-490edef23e72">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy continues covering the surviving individual. Any existing loans against the policy will decrease the final death benefit amount payable once both insureds pass.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="00523b0d-56f9-449b-a7f2-e7f02fe9d7d8">
  <data key="d3">After the first death, the policy continues covering the surviving individual, maintaining its validity until both insureds pass. This sustained status allows the claim process to proceed once evidence of both deaths is verified.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="8bb98441-7fce-4a4a-aaed-255a79d72dc9">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy stays active for the surviving insured. To confirm the first death and trigger the transition, a death certificate must be submitted as part of the claims procedure.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="58074012-c329-4400-8d8b-4167293c8593">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy stays active for the surviving insured, creating the condition under which the second death must be documented through official certification.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="e11b535f-c978-4ee3-a0fb-67b135406066">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured passes, the policy stays active for the remaining individual, but since benefits are contingent on both deaths, no payment is issued at this point.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_PAYOUT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="4f649562-2015-4f25-ae81-7c5444b996c4">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 explains that the policy stays active post-first-death and maintains coverage for the remaining individual. This directly supports fact_sentence_2 by providing context for why the policy continues in force.</data>
  <data key="d4">REINFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="b139e470-7b32-4675-85c3-cec60a1f5146">
  <data key="d3">After the first death, the policy continues for the surviving individual, ensuring ongoing coverage until both insureds pass. Claim forms must eventually be submitted once both deaths are confirmed and documented.</data>
  <data key="d4">POSTPONES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="539e1a9d-20b3-4a9d-906a-7f04bb12c255">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy continues to cover the remaining individual. Once complete documentation is received, the insurer processes the claim and issues the death benefit within 30 days.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="b917e56c-f863-4041-b852-b34740f1b439">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy stays active for the remaining individual, ensuring continued protection. This continuation necessitates that premium payments persist despite the change in insured parties.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTINUES WITH</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="a4c41a3b-9c7f-4b98-a6b4-986121ed83de">
  <data key="d3">After the first death, the policy stays active for the remaining insured. Administratively, the surviving insured is reclassified under a single-life whole life policy framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRANSITION TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="25f4e64b-7adb-4f44-892f-2d9bd49fdc83">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured passes away, the policy continues to cover the remaining individual, maintaining its validity and ongoing obligations. This continuity is formally acknowledged through written notification sent to the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="a9ec20a6-7d7d-487c-a092-216f40615962">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy stays active for the surviving individual. To confirm eligibility for continued coverage, the insurer requires official verification through the submission of the first insured’s death certificate.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="fe6ae23c-acf1-4ce0-b10a-d43f8f1cd48e">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy stays active for the remaining individual, and the original $2.5 million death benefit remains intact, ensuring consistent protection without reduction.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTINUES_WITH</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy persists to cover the remaining individual, but the claim about fixed premiums lacks support from the detailed terms, which allow for future increases.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy continues covering the remaining individual, maintaining its validity throughout the initial ten-year term during which the premium is locked at $32,400.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTINUES DURING</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="8aef280a-0c9a-40d3-968e-a753e7c3402f">
  <data key="d3">The policy continues providing coverage for the surviving insured after the first death, independent of later premium increases that may occur after Year 10.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34">
  <data key="d3">The policy continues to provide coverage for the surviving insured after the first death, but this does not influence when premiums are due. Premiums remain payable regardless of whether one or both insured individuals are alive.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="b9253ffc-7436-4d11-a036-5b41d8c8e66d">
  <data key="d3">After the first death, the policy stays active for the remaining insured individual, ensuring continued protection. As part of this continuation, premiums must still be paid to maintain the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRES_PAYMENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="e3c7d76f-bcfb-4c2d-988d-e3fa8983ae3e">
  <data key="d3">The policy continues covering the surviving insured after the first death, ensuring ongoing protection regardless of later premium adjustments. This continued validity sets the stage for potential changes like increased premiums after Year 10.</data>
  <data key="d4">POSTPONED_CONSEQUENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="0e404f06-62de-4907-9ecb-1ee9ca03ea3f">
  <data key="d3">Since the policy is designed as a Second-to-Die Whole Life plan, its survival-based structure inherently ensures that coverage persists beyond the first death, supporting the claim made in fact_sentence_1 about the policy remaining in force under these conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="2d075601-ee57-47c1-9e7a-50f0b163454b">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 highlights the policy’s continued validity after the first death, which logically follows from fact_sentence_1’s assertion that it insures two lives under one contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557" target="3f6d4cab-62b6-49d1-b92d-102a4aed9d13">
  <data key="d3">Since the death benefit requires the second insured’s passing, the policy must remain active after the first death, supporting the continuity noted in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
