</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="c572616e-c975-4080-b949-ca3f8247c18e">
  <data key="d3">The projected cash value of $712,000 at year 20 reinforces the policy’s utility in estate planning by demonstrating significant accumulated equity over time, aligning with its intended use for wealth transfer and succession management.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="a9741679-16e2-4128-9ef2-70da1404cc14">
  <data key="d3">The ability to split the policy after the first death enhances its functionality for estate planning, enabling customized arrangements that reflect updated beneficiary needs or legal requirements.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES_PURPOSE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="80ae385b-ee9d-4149-9014-5ca0ab9ab203">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to split the policy within two years of the first death facilitates its use in estate planning by allowing structural adjustments post-first death, such as dividing benefits for legal or financial reorganization.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_PURPOSE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="eead227f-2ad6-4a45-877d-62ba5081b981">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for evidence of insurability to split the policy enables its use in estate planning, such as restructuring assets post-divorce or adjusting trusts.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="3438d3e0-d9fb-46af-8d4c-8f979cc55d1f">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s design for estate planning enables its use in complex personal legal arrangements, including divorce or trust adjustments through the split feature described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="a08544cf-1d57-4a48-8d71-04334028f70e">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s estate planning intent is realized through its placement in an irrevocable trust, ensuring tax-free transfer of proceeds and aligning with long-term wealth preservation goals.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="cd2b5513-fe2d-4b70-b48a-c2748515cd09">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s estate planning intent is strengthened by the immediate payout provision in case of simultaneous deaths, ensuring swift transfer of assets to the trust without administrative delays.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="f8fdda5e-551c-4714-929d-a06d99b71f24">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s estate planning intent is enabled by the Trust’s control over it, including the authority to take loans, providing flexibility while maintaining asset protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES_PURPOSE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="8a12f494-7f87-46bf-8e19-a11973792e7f">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s estate planning purpose is reinforced by the Trust’s authority to surrender it, allowing strategic management of asset distribution and tax implications.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="09580835-e917-49b8-9fa3-3cd68120d06a">
  <data key="d3">The policy's estate planning purpose is realized through its placement in an irrevocable trust, ensuring exclusion from taxable estates when properly structured under tax rules like the three-year lookback and Crummey powers.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70" target="115deb5a-9af7-4024-bf11-8dba457cef0b">
  <data key="d3">The policy's estate planning purpose is enabled by the Trust’s authority to assign it, ensuring flexibility in asset management while maintaining exclusion from taxable estates.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_PURPOSE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
