  <data key="d3">A joint life insurance policy with a survivorship payout mechanism is specifically structured to meet estate tax liquidity needs through timely disbursement post-death of the last insured.</data>
  <data key="d4">DESIGNED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
