  <data key="d3">The policy’s structure—paying out only after both insureds have died—is specifically designed to provide liquidation capacity for estate taxes, fulfilling the functional intent behind the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
