  <data key="d3">The need to submit proof of both deaths ensures accurate claim validation, which aligns with the continued payment of premiums even after the first death, maintaining the policy's integrity until final settlement.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
