  <data key="d3">Once proof of both deaths is successfully submitted, the insurer commits to issuing payment within 30 days, making the initial step essential for activating this deadline.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
