  <data key="d3">The continued enforceability of the policy after the first death supports the long-term viability of the irrevocable trust arrangement intended to remove assets from taxable estates.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
