<edge source="b917e56c-f863-4041-b852-b34740f1b439" target="a4c41a3b-9c7f-4b98-a6b4-986121ed83de">
  <data key="d3">After the first death, continued premium payments ensure the policy remains active, prompting its transition into a single-life whole life policy for the surviving insured.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b917e56c-f863-4041-b852-b34740f1b439" target="fe6ae23c-acf1-4ce0-b10a-d43f8f1cd48e">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured's death, the premium obligation persists, ensuring the policy remains intact. This ongoing financial commitment supports the continued $2.5 million coverage until the second death occurs.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
