  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the surviving individual remains responsible for continuing premium payments, which occur annually on August 20th under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTINUES DURING</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b917e56c-f863-4041-b852-b34740f1b439" target="8aef280a-0c9a-40d3-968e-a753e7c3402f">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policyholder must still pay premiums, maintaining coverage until both lives end. This continued obligation extends into later years when the premium is capped at $48,600 annually after Year 10.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTINUES TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
