  <data key="d3">Receipt of written confirmation upon the first death is an administrative milestone that occurs regardless of the premium payment timeline. It serves informational purposes but has no bearing on the scheduled annual premium due dates.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
