  <data key="d3">The coverage amount remaining unchanged after the first death ensures that the policy retains its original purpose and value, making it possible to pay the full benefit upon the second death.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fe6ae23c-acf1-4ce0-b10a-d43f8f1cd48e" target="43d8caa1-4fa2-4bcc-9598-cb51dcf031e8">
  <data key="d3">The maintenance of the $2.5 million coverage after the first death reflects the core principle of a survivorship-based policy, where benefits are contingent solely on both lives terminating.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fe6ae23c-acf1-4ce0-b10a-d43f8f1cd48e" target="45022529-c9d1-42d4-978a-0e7ff593425f">
  <data key="d3">Even though no payment occurs at the first death, the policy maintains its original $2.5 million coverage, meaning the lack of immediate payout preserves the future claim eligibility tied to the survivorship clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">COVERAGE MAINTAINED → NO IMMEDIATE PAYMENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fe6ae23c-acf1-4ce0-b10a-d43f8f1cd48e" target="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557">
  <data key="d3">Because the coverage amount is preserved after the first death, the policy continues to provide full protection to the surviving insured, keeping it in effect under the same terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">MAINTAINED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fe6ae23c-acf1-4ce0-b10a-d43f8f1cd48e" target="bfe9a0f3-fce1-4c16-a4f6-2a78f6d39acf">
  <data key="d3">Since the coverage amount stays unchanged after the first death, it confirms that the death benefit is contingent solely on the simultaneous demise of both insured parties, aligning with the primary payout rule.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENSURES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fe6ae23c-acf1-4ce0-b10a-d43f8f1cd48e" target="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70">
  <data key="d3">Maintaining an unchanged coverage amount after the first death directly serves the policy’s primary function in estate planning by guaranteeing that the full $2.5 million is preserved for final settlement.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fe6ae23c-acf1-4ce0-b10a-d43f8f1cd48e" target="70d6f164-2c6e-4960-9154-c1e13245d12c">
  <data key="d3">Because the policy maintains its full coverage amount after the first death, it reliably serves its intended role in providing estate tax liquidity without reduction or uncertainty.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
