  <data key="d3">Even though one insured has died, the premium stays fixed at $32,400 annually due to the ten-year guarantee clause, ensuring continued coverage under modified terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">STAYS CONSTANT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="25f4e64b-7adb-4f44-892f-2d9bd49fdc83">
  <data key="d3">The premium remains fixed even after the first death, reflecting the policy’s guaranteed pricing structure. This stability follows from the administrative acknowledgment of the first death, confirmed through formal notification to the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="a9ec20a6-7d7d-487c-a092-216f40615962">
  <data key="d3">Premiums stay constant after the first death due to the ten-year guarantee period, irrespective of when or whether the death certificate is submitted.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="a4c41a3b-9c7f-4b98-a6b4-986121ed83de">
  <data key="d3">Despite the policy transitioning to a single-life format after the first death, the annual premium continues unchanged, maintaining its original amount regardless of the new policy type.</data>
  <data key="d4">MAINTAINS PREMIUM</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="fe6ae23c-acf1-4ce0-b10a-d43f8f1cd48e">
  <data key="d3">The premium continues unchanged after the first death, aligning with the unaltered coverage amount, maintaining financial consistency throughout the policy term.</data>
  <data key="d4">HAS_NO_EFFECT_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured's death, the premium remains unchanged due to its guarantee during the initial 10-year period, ensuring financial predictability despite administrative changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">GUARANTEED DURING PERIOD</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="e3c7d76f-bcfb-4c2d-988d-e3fa8983ae3e">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the premium stays fixed despite administrative changes, but this stable rate applies only until Year 10, beyond which an upward adjustment becomes possible based on policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">POSTPONED_CHANGE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="8aef280a-0c9a-40d3-968e-a753e7c3402f">
  <data key="d3">The premium remains fixed after the first death, maintaining its level through the initial guarantee period. After Year 10, even if rates increase, they are capped at $48,600 annually.</data>
  <data key="d4">STABILIZES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="b9253ffc-7436-4d11-a036-5b41d8c8e66d">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the premium continues to be required, maintaining its original level without adjustment despite the shift in policy status.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTINUES AT SAME RATE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the premium continues at the same rate, maintaining its scheduled annual payment deadline of August 20th without adjustment.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="09580835-e917-49b8-9fa3-3cd68120d06a">
  <data key="d3">The unchanged premium after the first death supports sustained coverage necessary for the irrevocable trust to achieve its goal of excluding proceeds from taxable estates by ensuring the policy survives beyond the first death.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="a08544cf-1d57-4a48-8d71-04334028f70e">
  <data key="d3">The continued payment of premiums after the first death is facilitated by the policy being held in an irrevocable trust, ensuring its independence from personal estate risks and enabling sustained coverage without disruption.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="cd2b5513-fe2d-4b70-b48a-c2748515cd09">
  <data key="d3">The stability of premiums post-first-death aligns with the policy’s survivorship framework, while the immediate payout for simultaneous deaths enhances its operational flexibility during rare overlapping mortality events.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="f8fdda5e-551c-4714-929d-a06d99b71f24">
  <data key="d3">The stable premium structure ensures ongoing coverage without immediate payout, enabling the trust to maintain long-term control and potentially utilize policy loans during the extended term.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="8a12f494-7f87-46bf-8e19-a11973792e7f">
  <data key="d3">After the first insured dies, the policy persists without changing its premium, allowing the Trust time to decide whether to maintain or surrender it based on long-term financial planning goals.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5" target="115deb5a-9af7-4024-bf11-8dba457cef0b">
  <data key="d3">The unchanging premium after the first death reflects ongoing policy maintenance by the trust, which retains full control over the contract, including financial commitments.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
