  <data key="d3">The annual premium is guaranteed at $32,400 for the first 10 years, independent of any changes in coverage status after the first death, such as the continued validity of the original $2.5 million benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5">
  <data key="d3">The $32,400 annual premium being guaranteed for the first decade implies it will remain stable even if one insured passes before the end of that term, supporting continuity beyond the first death.</data>
  <data key="d4">STABILIZES POST-FIRST DEATH</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="e3c7d76f-bcfb-4c2d-988d-e3fa8983ae3e">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed $32,400 annual premium applies only during the first 10 years. After this period, the premium may increase, reflecting an adjustment beyond the initial fixed rate.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="8aef280a-0c9a-40d3-968e-a753e7c3402f">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed $32,400 annual premium for the first 10 years creates a stable baseline, after which the premium may increase but is capped at $48,600 annually.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES AND CAPS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed premium amount of $32,400 applies over the initial decade, and payments for this amount are required annually by August 20th.</data>
  <data key="d4">PAYMENT SCHEDULE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="b9253ffc-7436-4d11-a036-5b41d8c8e66d">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed $32,400 annual premium for the first ten years ensures financial stability during early policy terms, and since premiums remain due post-first-death, this guarantees continued coverage until both lives end.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTINUES AFTER</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="0e404f06-62de-4907-9ecb-1ee9ca03ea3f">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 highlights the fixed premium duration, which aligns with and substantiates the claim in fact_sentence_1 regarding guaranteed premiums over ten years, reinforcing the policy's predictable cost structure.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONFIRMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="2d075601-ee57-47c1-9e7a-50f0b163454b">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 confirms the stable premium amount for the early years, which aligns with the broader purpose outlined in fact_sentence_1—to support long-term estate planning through predictable funding of a shared life insurance product.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="3f6d4cab-62b6-49d1-b92d-102a4aed9d13">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed $32,400 annual premium for 10 years enables continued coverage necessary for the second-to-die benefit to eventually trigger upon the later death of either insured.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="a08544cf-1d57-4a48-8d71-04334028f70e">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed level premium ensures predictable costs over the first decade, aligning with the long-term goals of an irrevocable trust holding the policy, enabling stable funding without unexpected increases affecting trust assets.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="f8fdda5e-551c-4714-929d-a06d99b71f24">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed premium term ensures stable cost during early policy years, supporting long-term planning, including potential future use of policy loans by the trust. This stability enables predictable funding for trust objectives involving asset liquidity.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="cd2b5513-fe2d-4b70-b48a-c2748515cd09">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of a fixed premium for ten years provides financial predictability, which supports the policyholder’s ability to maintain coverage long enough to trigger the immediate payout condition described in fact_sentence_2 when both insureds die simultaneously.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="09580835-e917-49b8-9fa3-3cd68120d06a">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed premium ensures stable funding for the policy, enabling consistent maintenance of its placement within the irrevocable trust, thereby supporting the goal of excluding death benefits from taxable estates.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="8a12f494-7f87-46bf-8e19-a11973792e7f">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed premium term provides financial predictability for the Trust managing the policy, supporting its decision-making around potential future surrender by ensuring stable costs during initial years.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2" target="115deb5a-9af7-4024-bf11-8dba457cef0b">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed premium ensures predictable costs during the policy’s early phase, supporting the trust’s capacity to manage and potentially assign the policy without immediate financial disruption.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="09dbfa97-3f4d-4895-ba03-f0f8d9670790" target="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has_guaranteed_premium_period</data>
</edge>
