  <data key="d3">The guarantee that premiums won’t exceed $48,600 annually after Year 10 reflects a pricing strategy designed to manage risk over time. This predictability complements the policy's core mechanism where benefits are deferred until both insureds die, ensuring affordability across the entire term.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
