  <data key="d3">Following the initial 10-year guarantee, any premium increase is constrained by a maximum cap of $48,600, ensuring predictability despite potential rises from the original $32,400 rate.</data>
  <data key="d4">LIMITED BY PRIOR GUARANTEE</data>
