<edge source="8aef280a-0c9a-40d3-968e-a753e7c3402f" target="2d075601-ee57-47c1-9e7a-50f0b163454b">
  <data key="d3">While fact_sentence_2 focuses on premium escalation limits after Year 10, it implicitly confirms the continued validity of the dual-insured structure from fact_sentence_1—since the policy remains active even after one death, supporting its role as a joint life instrument designed for estate planning purposes.</data>
