<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="ac80f582-a994-43e3-a0c9-7da66f0fc96b">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments on August 20th apply to the joint life insurance policy described, reflecting one of its administrative requirements.</data>
  <data key="d4">PAYMENT_SCHEDULE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="f7b2d174-40c9-40e2-a0f1-fafef35a9501">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments are required under the policy, which is designed to cover two lives. Payment timing does not alter the multi-lifetime coverage provision.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="c77b94e8-ba17-40c7-a87e-8036edb72fd7">
  <data key="d3">Annual premiums are required on August 20th irrespective of whether either insured has died. This obligation continues even though the death benefit is not released until both insured persons pass away.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="43d8caa1-4fa2-4bcc-9598-cb51dcf031e8">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments occur on August 20th regardless of the survival status of either insured individual, independent of whether the death benefit has been triggered.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="45022529-c9d1-42d4-978a-0e7ff593425f">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments scheduled for August 20th occur independently of whether a death benefit is triggered by the first death. Payment deadlines are unaffected by claims eligibility conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="e3ba5ff9-a204-4af4-850d-38d792f8f557">
  <data key="d3">Annual premiums are required on August 20th, irrespective of the number of living insured parties. This obligation persists even after the first death, ensuring continued coverage under the survivorship terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="bfe9a0f3-fce1-4c16-a4f6-2a78f6d39acf">
  <data key="d3">Annual premiums are due on August 20th irrespective of claim events. This obligation exists independently of whether the death benefit has been triggered by the dual demise of the insureds.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="5f7b886a-0895-4321-a983-5dcc79a03f70">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments on August 20th occur regardless of the policy's role in estate planning. This scheduling is unrelated to its functional purpose.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="70d6f164-2c6e-4960-9154-c1e13245d12c">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 outlines the annual deadline for premium payments, while fact sentence 1 describes the policy’s role in estate planning. The payment schedule supports ongoing coverage but does not determine or relate directly to the policy’s estate tax function.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="30aa32c7-4f8f-42cf-99bf-592ed9d2eaab">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 establishes an ongoing financial commitment tied to the policy's maintenance, occurring regardless of any death event. Fact sentence 1 defines the sole trigger for the large payout, which occurs long after regular premium payments may cease if the second death happens early.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="69f86d86-8dc3-4e5c-963e-490edef23e72">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 establishes that premiums are due annually on August 20th. This schedule does not affect how loans impact the death benefit described in fact sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="00523b0d-56f9-449b-a7f2-e7f02fe9d7d8">
  <data key="d3">Annual premiums due on August 20th are part of ongoing policy maintenance and do not affect or rely on the need to provide proof of both deaths for a claim.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="8bb98441-7fce-4a4a-aaed-255a79d72dc9">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments due on August 20th are part of ongoing policy maintenance and are independent of the need to provide a death certificate for claim purposes.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="58074012-c329-4400-8d8b-4167293c8593">
  <data key="d3">Annual premiums are required regardless of any death events and are due on August 20th each year. This recurring financial obligation does not depend on whether a death certificate for the second insured has been submitted.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="b139e470-7b32-4675-85c3-cec60a1f5146">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 specifies that premiums are due annually on August 20th, establishing a recurring financial obligation. This deadline has no bearing on the process of submitting claim forms, which occurs separately during claims administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="539e1a9d-20b3-4a9d-906a-7f04bb12c255">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments are required regardless of claims activity and are independent of when benefits are disbursed.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="e11b535f-c978-4ee3-a0fb-67b135406066">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments scheduled for August 20th occur regardless of whether one or both insured individuals have died.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="4f649562-2015-4f25-ae81-7c5444b996c4">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 indicates that premiums are required annually on August 20th regardless of whether one or both insured persons remain alive. This obligation persists even after the first death, maintaining the policy's validity under its survivorship terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="b917e56c-f863-4041-b852-b34740f1b439">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments due on August 20th persist even after the first death, ensuring the policy stays active until both insured persons pass away.</data>
  <data key="d4">OCCURS ON SCHEDULE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="25f4e64b-7adb-4f44-892f-2d9bd49fdc83">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments are required on August 20th irrespective of any events related to the death of one insured party. This obligation continues even after the first death, independent of whether confirmation was received.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="a9ec20a6-7d7d-487c-a092-216f40615962">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments on August 20th occur irrespective of any death event, including the filing of a death certificate, and do not influence when such documents need to be submitted.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="a4c41a3b-9c7f-4b98-a6b4-986121ed83de">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments are scheduled for August 20th regardless of whether the policy has been administratively adjusted to a single-life form after the first death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="fe6ae23c-acf1-4ce0-b10a-d43f8f1cd48e">
  <data key="d3">Annual premiums are required by August 20th each year, forming part of the ongoing cost of maintaining the policy. This obligation persists whether or not a death has occurred yet.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="9ff1d8f5-8894-4692-b73d-1e4ea24edfc5">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums annually on August 20th persists even after the first death, ensuring continued coverage despite changes in policy status.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2">
  <data key="d3">Annual premiums of $32,400, guaranteed for the first ten years, are due every August 20th.</data>
  <data key="d4">GUARANTEED AMOUNT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="e3c7d76f-bcfb-4c2d-988d-e3fa8983ae3e">
  <data key="d3">Annual premium payments are required on August 20th, but this timing does not influence whether premiums might increase after Year 10. The due date is independent of the pricing adjustment clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3d46018a-fc19-4870-ba86-8b6a02b20a34" target="8aef280a-0c9a-40d3-968e-a753e7c3402f">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that premiums be paid annually on August 20th has no bearing on the ceiling amount of $48,600 set for post-Year 10 premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
