  <data key="d3">The requirement for annual premium payments on August 20th persists beyond the first death, ensuring ongoing coverage under the survivorship policy until both insured parties pass away.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTINUES AFTER</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
