  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 describes the consequences of missed payments, including a 60-day grace period before cancellation. This information is independent of how policy loans are priced.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
