  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period allows time to pay overdue premiums without losing coverage, ensuring continuity needed to meet future requirements such as providing evidence of insurability for splitting the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY SUPPORTS</data>
