  <data key="d3">A 60-day grace period allows delayed premium payments without immediate cancellation, supporting ongoing policy viability. This stability enables future actions such as splitting the policy during events like divorce or trust modifications.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
