  <data key="d3">Guaranteed cash value growth makes the policy particularly suitable for estate planning objectives, enabling strategic wealth transfer and management over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">FACILITATES_PLANNING</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
