  <data key="d3">The projected cash value increase over ten years relies on uninterrupted premium payments; therefore, maintaining the same premium rate post-first-death is essential to achieving this target.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
