  <data key="d3">The projection of $285,000 in cash value after 10 years confirms the existence of a guaranteed accumulation process outlined in the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6dc8ff62-eea3-490e-8bcb-f8de9a7857c7" target="c572616e-c975-4080-b949-ca3f8247c18e">
  <data key="d3">The projected cash value of $285,000 at year 10 serves as a milestone that supports the longer-term projection of $712,000 at year 20, reflecting sustained growth under the policy’s guarantees.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
