  <data key="d3">The projected cash value after 10 years reflects long-term accumulation under fixed assumptions, independent of short-term loan interest rates that apply only when borrowing against the policy’s value.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6dc8ff62-eea3-490e-8bcb-f8de9a7857c7" target="d94c663a-259e-482b-a866-3027a5c20ec9">
  <data key="d3">The projected cash value of $285,000 by year 10 determines the basis for calculating the maximum loan amount under the policy, which is capped at 90% of the cash surrender value.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6dc8ff62-eea3-490e-8bcb-f8de9a7857c7" target="09895f11-033a-47ca-8643-e10cf716e712">
  <data key="d3">The projected cash value of $285,000 after ten years relies on guaranteed growth assumptions that operate independently of when policy loans become accessible.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6dc8ff62-eea3-490e-8bcb-f8de9a7857c7" target="9c47d13a-d692-4392-baa2-0c2fae92d3d2">
  <data key="d3">The projected cash value of $285,000 after 10 years establishes a foundation for potential borrowing capacity; however, any loans taken against it will directly diminish the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6dc8ff62-eea3-490e-8bcb-f8de9a7857c7" target="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127">
  <data key="d3">The projected cash value increase over ten years depends on the policy’s restrictions; since partial withdrawals are disallowed, the accumulated value cannot be accessed during the term, preserving it for eventual death benefits or full surrender.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6dc8ff62-eea3-490e-8bcb-f8de9a7857c7" target="0ac06249-c2b3-4788-84f9-796a3b669e1f">
  <data key="d3">The projected cash value of $285,000 after 10 years reflects long-term accumulation under fixed assumptions, whereas policy loans may be accessed at any point post-issue, including before or after the first death. These elements operate independently within the policy's framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
