  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="4b76e6c5-ecf9-4bb8-9854-bd6d045f31a1">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">EXCLUSION</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="a9e7f4af-ec56-47d8-ac60-93deb168dbf1">
  <data key="d3">Restrictions on partial withdrawals mean that policyholders cannot access any portion of the growing cash value during the term. This limitation exists alongside the fixed annual premium of $48,600, which remains unchanged even when such withdrawals would otherwise be possible.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="2461f012-1c2a-4b80-84ff-a70ea9af51ba">
  <data key="d3">The prohibition on partial withdrawals aligns with the need for stable, uninterrupted premium payments, ensuring funds accumulate predictably over time without interference from early access.</data>
  <data key="d4">REINFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="1ec93897-4582-467c-9df8-bc0d20aec783">
  <data key="d3">Restrictions on partial withdrawals limit liquidity options regardless of when premiums remain unchanged. This constraint exists irrespective of whether premiums persist after the first death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="3b80d1cc-14b1-44a5-b6e4-b4d970384d8d">
  <data key="d3">Prohibiting partial withdrawals ensures that cash value remains untouched except through full surrender or splitting, which aligns with the lack of premium waiver coverage, collectively limiting options for managing financial strain without forfeiting policy benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY LIMITATIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="3e0929d5-298d-4dde-8125-af7d9ada617a">
  <data key="d3">Prohibiting partial withdrawals ensures that even during a grace period, no funds can be withdrawn from the policy's cash value, maintaining its integrity until full resolution of delinquency.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO DIRECT RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="76304af0-638b-4ac0-813d-d9e1573697f3">
  <data key="d3">Prohibiting partial withdrawals ensures that the cash value remains undisturbed, allowing its guaranteed growth over time without reduction from external use.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="6dc8ff62-eea3-490e-8bcb-f8de9a7857c7">
  <data key="d3">The prohibition on partial withdrawals ensures that the cash value remains intact, supporting long-term projections such as the $285,000 target after 10 years by preventing early depletion.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONSTRAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="c572616e-c975-4080-b949-ca3f8247c18e">
  <data key="d3">Because partial withdrawals are disallowed, the significant projected cash value of $712,000 after 20 years remains inaccessible through withdrawal, preserving it for other uses such as loan collateral or death benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">RESTRICTED BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="09895f11-033a-47ca-8643-e10cf716e712">
  <data key="d3">The prohibition on partial withdrawals means policyholders cannot draw money from the cash value directly; however, they may still utilize policy loans after meeting the two-year waiting period, offering an alternative method of accessing built-up value.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="d94c663a-259e-482b-a866-3027a5c20ec9">
  <data key="d3">Although partial withdrawals are strictly forbidden, policyholders may still borrow up to 90% of the cash surrender value after meeting eligibility requirements, offering an alternative route to access funds despite the restriction on direct withdrawals.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="344050b8-4052-4992-8796-fb1bb3c2e00a">
  <data key="d3">Although the policy disallows partial withdrawals entirely, borrowers may still take out loans secured by the cash value, accruing interest at a variable rate of 5.5%.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="9c47d13a-d692-4392-baa2-0c2fae92d3d2">
  <data key="d3">The ban on partial withdrawals means policyholders cannot take out funds without triggering full surrender risks; however, this rule operates independently of how loans impact the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="0ac06249-c2b3-4788-84f9-796a3b669e1f">
  <data key="d3">The prohibition on partial withdrawals means that only full surrenders or loans may be accessed, yet even with such limitations, policy loans remain accessible either before or after the first death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="80ae385b-ee9d-4149-9014-5ca0ab9ab203">
  <data key="d3">The restriction against partial withdrawals limits immediate access to funds, independent of the timing requirement for electing policy splits after the first death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="a9741679-16e2-4128-9ef2-70da1404cc14">
  <data key="d3">The restriction against partial withdrawals ensures that the policy's accumulated cash value remains preserved, supporting its potential use in future splits after the first death.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="c0978b9e-d3be-4833-93c7-b90a6f87d86b">
  <data key="d3">The inability to make partial withdrawals ensures financial stability and prevents erosion of the policy's value prior to potential splits, creating necessary preconditions for equitable distribution through actuarial methods.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070">
  <data key="d3">The prohibition on partial withdrawals ensures funds remain locked until specified events occur, such as death or splitting the policy. This restriction does not influence the outcome of suicide-related claims, which depend solely on timing relative to policy inception.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="47f15981-6589-47fa-8b46-dc246096d7cb">
  <data key="d3">The prohibition on partial withdrawals reflects one limitation in policy liquidity, while the rare use of the split option indicates limited demand for restructuring the policy post-first-death. Both highlight conservative usage patterns but do not directly influence each other.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO DIRECT RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="6423aae2-3458-45ed-a68e-9f42cae005bf">
  <data key="d3">The prohibition on partial withdrawals relates to fund accessibility, while the split option applies exclusively to exceptional dual-death scenarios requiring medical ambiguity. These clauses address different aspects of policy flexibility without influencing each other directly.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="eead227f-2ad6-4a45-877d-62ba5081b981">
  <data key="d3">The prohibition on partial withdrawals reinforces the policy’s design toward long-term preservation of value, aligning with conditions such as requiring evidence of insurability before splitting the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONSISTENT_WITH</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="3438d3e0-d9fb-46af-8d4c-8f979cc55d1f">
  <data key="d3">The prohibition on partial withdrawals ensures funds remain locked until specific events occur, such as the split option activation post-first-death. This constraint supports long-term financial integrity while enabling strategic restructuring through splits during major life transitions.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127" target="017f6bf7-89af-44fe-8781-e25d1c431f9c">
  <data key="d3">The prohibition on partial withdrawals ensures financial discipline and preserves the policy's integrity until specified conditions are met, such as surviving past the first death event required for splitting.</data>
  <data key="d4">REINFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0baa044f-0f46-4511-aa7f-288cd491c693" target="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">excludes_partial_withdrawal</data>
</edge>
