  <data key="d3">Although the policy allows splitting into two single-life policies after the first death under specific conditions, this provision is infrequently invoked. Its rarity does not affect the availability or use of policy loans, which remain accessible regardless of such splits.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
