  <data key="d3">Although the split option is available under specified conditions, including timely execution within two years of the first death, it is rarely exercised in practice, likely due to complexity or alternative financial strategies.</data>
  <data key="d4">LOW UTILIZATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
