  <data key="d3">Although each new policy receives its face amount through actuarial allocation upon division, this process occurs so rarely that it has minimal real-world impact.</data>
  <data key="d4">RARELY USED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
