  <data key="d3">Although the split option requires both insured parties to still be alive at the first death, its actual use remains rare, suggesting limited practical application even under qualifying conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">LOW_USAGE_CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47f15981-6589-47fa-8b46-dc246096d7cb" target="eead227f-2ad6-4a45-877d-62ba5081b981">
