</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="a9e7f4af-ec56-47d8-ac60-93deb168dbf1">
  <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion clause impacts payout eligibility during the initial two-year period, regardless of premium payments. While the premium ensures ongoing coverage, its amount has no bearing on whether the suicide provision applies.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="2461f012-1c2a-4b80-84ff-a70ea9af51ba">
  <data key="d3">The suicide clause, which invalidates the death benefit if one insured dies by suicide within two years of issuance, operates independently of the premium payment schedule but applies during the early phase of the policy’s term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.25</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="1ec93897-4582-467c-9df8-bc0d20aec783">
  <data key="d3">A suicide occurring within two years of issuance nullifies the death benefit regardless of continued premium payments after the first death, meaning this event overrides any prior obligation fulfillment.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXCLUDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="3b80d1cc-14b1-44a5-b6e4-b4d970384d8d">
  <data key="d3">Suicide within two years of issuance voids the death benefit, creating a separate exclusion from coverage unrelated to premium payment relief—this condition stands irrespective of whether premium waiver were available.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENTLY RELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="3e0929d5-298d-4dde-8125-af7d9ada617a">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 identifies a condition that nullifies the death benefit regardless of payment status. Fact sentence 1 explains what happens when premiums aren't paid, which does not depend on the cause of death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="76304af0-638b-4ac0-813d-d9e1573697f3">
  <data key="d3">The suicide provision limits liability under certain circumstances, independent of how the cash value accrues, which remains unaffected by such events unless it impacts claim validity indirectly through policy lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="6dc8ff62-eea3-490e-8bcb-f8de9a7857c7">
  <data key="d3">A suicide clause affecting the death benefit applies regardless of future cash value accumulation, making it relevant across all stages including year 10.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="c572616e-c975-4080-b949-ca3f8247c18e">
  <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion impacts claim eligibility shortly after policy inception, regardless of future cash value growth projections.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="09895f11-033a-47ca-8643-e10cf716e712">
  <data key="d3">Suicide within two years affects the death benefit regardless of when loans may become accessible. This clause limits payout under certain circumstances without influencing loan eligibility timelines.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="d94c663a-259e-482b-a866-3027a5c20ec9">
  <data key="d3">Suicide within two years invalidates the death benefit regardless of available loan provisions derived from cash surrender value.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="344050b8-4052-4992-8796-fb1bb3c2e00a">
  <data key="d3">A suicide clause that voids the death benefit within two years has no bearing on the variable interest rate charged for policy loans, as they operate under separate policy conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="9c47d13a-d692-4392-baa2-0c2fae92d3d2">
  <data key="d3">The suicide clause invalidates the death benefit if triggered, whereas loan usage gradually decreases it over time. These are independent reasons why beneficiaries may receive less than the full amount.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="0ac06249-c2b3-4788-84f9-796a3b669e1f">
  <data key="d3">The suicide provision applies regardless of whether loans have been taken out. Loan activity has no bearing on the validity of the death benefit when suicide occurs within the exclusion period.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="0df8a60d-2dd5-49e0-a026-86763abbc127">
  <data key="d3">A suicide clause invalidating the death benefit applies regardless of withdrawal rules. The absence of partial withdrawals has no bearing on whether the suicide provision triggers its effect.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="a9741679-16e2-4128-9ef2-70da1404cc14">
  <data key="d3">A suicide clause voiding the death benefit applies regardless of future policy splits. Whether the policy is divided later has no bearing on eligibility for payout during the initial two-year exclusion period.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="80ae385b-ee9d-4149-9014-5ca0ab9ab203">
  <data key="d3">Whether suicide occurs within two years of issuance impacts eligibility for the death benefit independently of when the split decision is made after the first death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="c0978b9e-d3be-4833-93c7-b90a6f87d86b">
  <data key="d3">Suicide within two years invalidates the death benefit, which could impact whether splitting occurs successfully, especially since such an event would terminate coverage before any potential split.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="6423aae2-3458-45ed-a68e-9f42cae005bf">
  <data key="d3">Suicide within two years invalidates the death benefit regardless of whether a split was possible or occurred. This rule operates independently of the split provision's eligibility criteria.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="017f6bf7-89af-44fe-8781-e25d1c431f9c">
  <data key="d3">Suicide within two years nullifies the death benefit, meaning even if the first death occurs, the surviving individual cannot access the proceeds. This affects the feasibility of using the split option since the death benefit would not be payable, making the split irrelevant.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXCLUSIONARY_CONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="eead227f-2ad6-4a45-877d-62ba5081b981">
  <data key="d3">A suicide within two years invalidates the death benefit regardless of any other terms, including whether evidence of insurability was submitted later. This restriction stands apart from administrative requirements such as those needed for splitting the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="47f15981-6589-47fa-8b46-dc246096d7cb">
  <data key="d3">A suicide occurring within two years affects the death benefit regardless of whether the split option is ever exercised.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7de08c0f-b0ef-4ad9-9926-43321fd05070" target="3438d3e0-d9fb-46af-8d4c-8f979cc55d1f">
  <data key="d3">A suicide occurring within two years of issuance invalidates the death benefit. This restriction remains unchanged even if the policy is later split into individual policies for purposes like divorce or trust adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
