<edge source="515adf3c-dada-471d-b601-2735aabcc010" target="f8fdda5e-551c-4714-929d-a06d99b71f24">
  <data key="d3">The statement about contestability being limited to when both insureds are alive does not directly influence or depend on the Trust’s ability to take policy loans. These are independent provisions governing different aspects of policy administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
