</edge>
<edge source="515adf3c-dada-471d-b601-2735aabcc010" target="8a12f494-7f87-46bf-8e19-a11973792e7f">
  <data key="d3">Contestability depends on the living status of both insured parties, but the Trust’s power to surrender the policy exists independently of their life statuses, governed by fiduciary authority rather than personal eligibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT OF</data>
