  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 states that war exclusions do not apply to the policy, meaning coverage remains intact regardless of cause of death involving warfare. This information is independent of the suicide clause’s payout limitations described in fact sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
