  <data key="d3">The lack of war exclusions means the policy covers deaths resulting from warfare-related incidents, independent of how the suicide clause behaves when the policy is reinstated.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
