  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 states that war exclusions do not apply, which is unrelated to the requirement that contestability only operates when both insureds are alive. No logical connection exists between the presence of exclusion types and survivorship rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
