  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states there are no war exclusions, while fact sentence 2 confirms no travel exclusions exist. Both statements independently reinforce the broad coverage of the policy by eliminating common exclusion categories.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
