  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states that war exclusions do not apply, meaning the policy covers deaths resulting from war-related causes. This detail pertains to insurance coverage conditions but does not influence or relate to the policy's ownership structure.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
