<edge source="09580835-e917-49b8-9fa3-3cd68120d06a" target="5acf973b-a6fa-47ab-9191-07ee99127659">
  <data key="d3">Holding the policy in an irrevocable trust aims to remove it from taxable estates, a goal unrelated to the conditions under which the suicide clause triggers payouts.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
