  <data key="d3">The use of an irrevocable trust aims to remove policy proceeds from taxable estates, while the simultaneous death provision ensures prompt payment when joint fatalities occur without clear survivorship. These provisions serve different purposes within the policy framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
