  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd2b5513-fe2d-4b70-b48a-c2748515cd09" target="5cdd5a6a-21a2-42b9-9024-4e7d8ff292a2">
  <data key="d3">The provision allowing immediate payment upon simultaneous death overrides typical procedural delays tied to proving sequential deaths, ensuring timely access to the $2.5 million benefit even during periods of guaranteed-level premiums outlined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd2b5513-fe2d-4b70-b48a-c2748515cd09" target="8aef280a-0c9a-40d3-968e-a753e7c3402f">
  <data key="d3">While fact_sentence_2 outlines accelerated payout eligibility during simultaneous deaths, fact_sentence_1 provides assurance about sustained premium stability beyond Year 10, ensuring financial predictability even under such high-risk events.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="eebd29ce-3446-4544-9a0d-822846fc8e1e" target="cd2b5513-fe2d-4b70-b48a-c2748515cd09">
