<edge source="115deb5a-9af7-4024-bf11-8dba457cef0b" target="2a7bb337-8c7a-449a-afa2-d4bb6e199209">
  <data key="d3">The Trust’s right to assign the policy enables it to restructure ownership arrangements, which may necessitate updating beneficiary designations accordingly.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="115deb5a-9af7-4024-bf11-8dba457cef0b" target="f8fdda5e-551c-4714-929d-a06d99b71f24">
  <data key="d3">The Trust’s authority to assign the policy enables it to transfer ownership interests, while its ability to take policy loans allows access to cash value. Both functions support flexible financial management within the trust framework.</data>
