  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="115deb5a-9af7-4024-bf11-8dba457cef0b" target="8a12f494-7f87-46bf-8e19-a11973792e7f">
  <data key="d3">The Trust’s right to assign the policy reflects its comprehensive control over policy disposition, enabling it to transfer ownership. This power supports the Trust’s capacity to surrender the policy when necessary, reinforcing its role as sole owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
