  <data key="d3">The Trust’s power to assign the policy serves the estate planning intent by allowing strategic transfer or restructuring without triggering adverse tax consequences.</data>
  <data key="d4">FULFILLS_OBJECTIVE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
