  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="115deb5a-9af7-4024-bf11-8dba457cef0b" target="e11b535f-c978-4ee3-a0fb-67b135406066">
  <data key="d3">Although the trust may assign the policy, such action does not affect the core provision that the death benefit is payable only after both insureds pass away, preserving the survivorship requirement.</data>
