  <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 provides essential operational specifics—such as premium payments, cash value growth, loan provisions, and splitting options—that define what the policy actually does, making it actionable under the trust-based framework described.</data>
  <data key="d4">PROVIDES_CONTEXT</data>
