  <data key="d3">The existence of a 30-day free look period allowing full refunds upon cancellation has no bearing on whether the policy can be assigned without trustee consent. Each rule applies to distinct operational conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
